{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00040","headline":"喜雪 · 太宗皇帝","name":"喜雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧昏朝合雾，丹卷暝韬霞。\n结叶繁云色，凝璚徧雪华。\n光楼皎若粉，映幕集疑沙。\n泛柳飞飞絮，粧梅片片花。\n照璧台圆月，飘珠箔穿露。\n瑶洁短长阶，玉藂高下树。\n映桐珪累白，萦峰莲抱素。\n断续气将沈，徘徊岁云暮。\n怀珍媿隐德，表瑞伫丰年。\n橤间飞禁苑，鹤处舞伊川。\n傥咏幽兰曲，同懽黄竹篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}